sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Client
    participant SessGW as Session Gateway
    participant SessCtrl as Session Controller
    participant Orch as Orchestrator Service
    participant MsgRepo as Message Repository
    participant PG as Postgres
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ

    User->>Client: End session
    Client->>SessGW: POST /sessions/:id/close
    SessGW->>SessCtrl: closeSession(id)
    SessCtrl->>Orch: finalizeSession(id)
    Orch->>MsgRepo: write final summary/system notes
    MsgRepo->>PG: INSERT summary
    Orch-->>SessCtrl: status=CLOSED
    SessCtrl-->>SessGW: 200 CLOSED
    SessGW-->>Client: ok
    Orch-->>MQ: publish simulation.completed
